      "instance_name": "contempt",
      "label": "derogatory contempt",
      "description": "The text 'trans-sports: allowing medicore male athletes to finally become champions' expresses contempt toward transgender athletes by mocking their athletic ability and implying their success is illegitimate or achieved through deception (gender transition). The term 'medicore' is used pejoratively to demean their skill, and the phrase 'finally become champions' suggests they are undeserving or only achieving status through unfair means. This contempt is directed at transgender individuals based on their gender identity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
