      "label": "The woman in the image is mapped as a 'trans-sports' athlete",
      "description": "The text 'trans-sports' is directly juxtaposed with the visual of the woman, implying she is an example or representative of 'trans-sports'. The meme uses her visual presence to embody the concept of 'trans-sports' as defined by the derogatory text, which frames transgender athletes as 'medicore male athletes' who 'finally become champions'. This mapping projects the textual concept 'trans-sports' onto the visual entity 'woman' to create a derogatory association.",
